  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=加入我們的 Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools 是 Mekanism 的官方附加模組，為各種 Mekanism 材料以及部分原版材料新增了工具與盔甲。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>提供以下材料的盔甲、盾牌與工具（包含 Paxel，即斧、鎬、鏟三合一工具）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青銅</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青金石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">銥</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">提純螢石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">提純黑曜石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鋼</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">此外還包含適用於原版工具類型的 Paxel：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">木材</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">石頭</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鐵</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">金</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鑽石</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模組連結：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>說明文件</strong>&nbsp;可於 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方維基</a> 查閱，該維基由 IndieWikis 提供託管服務！目前仍在持續完善中，若您有時間，歡迎踊躍貢獻！</p>\n<p><strong>原始碼&nbsp;</strong>可於 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 取得！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>透過 Patreon 支持團隊：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>透過 Ko-fi 支持團隊：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>",
